My recommendation for your Java learning sequence:
1. Generics fundamentals.
2. Generic classes and methods.
3. Bounded types.
4. Wildcards and PECS.
5. Type Erasure.
6. Collections Framework (List, Set, Map, Queue).
Don't jump straight into wildcards before you can independently write a generic class and generic method. That's the foundation.